        "\n",
        "Draft. Steps:\n",
        "1. Load QASPER (test split) and look at ONE paper and ONE question.\n",
        "2. Turn papers into paragraphs, map gold evidence to paragraphs.\n",
        "3. Fixed evaluation subset (300 questions), saved to `results/qasper_eval_subset.json`.\n",
        "4. Three chunking strategies.\n",
        "5. BM25 / Dense / Hybrid / Hybrid + Cross-Encoder **inside each paper**, reusing `src/retrieval.py`.\n",
        "6. One results table: method × chunking.\n",
        "\n",
